      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Can we also have the ability to toggle chairs on and off locally? I’d be nice to not constantly sit down when in a space with chairs surrounding you. Especially when some chairs can be sat in from 10 feet away\n\nSome people have facial expressions set to gestures, such as myself. I rely on my gestures to make communicating and expressing myself more animated. But I always find myself teleporting behind or away from my friend because I sat in a chair when gesturing a smile.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
