      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I upvoted this post but as a world creator, it’s a gray area. Particles are often used for important visual or collision based effects, so if something like this is implemented, worlds should have an option to override the settings perhaps? Mirrors are probably fine but other things that affect the world experience are very iffy. Turning off dust mote decoration particles is different than turning off NPC bullet particles.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
